      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "41e3e263_441e4661",
        "filename": "common/weaver_ng.c",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 91,
      "author": {
        "id": 1135824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-19T10:02:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So your label values are left-aligned (i.e. using the MSB) in the uint64_t? Wouldn\u0027t it be simpler to align them on the right instead?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 90,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 91,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "bf47c6921a44528be02283f2358566abd5cc03c2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "18bf8147_ef41d9c9",
        "filename": "common/weaver_ng.c",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 91,
      "author": {
        "id": 1160200
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-20T18:57:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can do either. What matters is that it is consistent on the AP side.\nAckn",
      "parentUuid": "41e3e263_441e4661",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 90,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 91,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "bf47c6921a44528be02283f2358566abd5cc03c2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0eb68895_9ca68d49",
        "filename": "common/weaver_ng.c",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 523,
      "author": {
        "id": 1135824
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-19T10:02:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This introduces a timing side channel that you need to avoid (i.e. allowing an attacker that observes and early return to kill power to H1 so the attempt doesn\u0027t get counted).\n\nWe need constant time operations to the point where the root hash update has landed in NVRAM.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 522,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 523,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "bf47c6921a44528be02283f2358566abd5cc03c2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d7d77bd9_ec07d14c",
        "filename": "common/weaver_ng.c",
        "patchSetId": 14
      },
      "lineNbr": 523,
      "author": {
        "id": 1160200
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-20T18:57:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t count attempts that aren\u0027t made---if the attempt is rate limited, no attempt is made or recorded.",
      "parentUuid": "0eb68895_9ca68d49",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 522,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 523,
        "endChar": 13
